uzong:p030","quote":"膠東康王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p001","quote":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王，而母五人，同母者為宗親。栗姬子曰榮、德、閼于。程姬子曰餘、非、端。賈夫人子曰彭祖、勝。唐姬子曰發。王夫人兒姁子曰越、寄、乘、舜。","source_term":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-021","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003600"]},{"id":"1c8_u63_bk4_KA","label":"賢（五宗世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"賢","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0103","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0142"]},{"surface":"膠東王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0144"]},{"surface":"膠東王賢","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0000"]},{"surface":"哀王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0012"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0103","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"賢"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0142","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"賢"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0144","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"膠東王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029","quote":"膠東王賢"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029","quote":"哀王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"膠東康王寄，以孝景中二年用皇子為膠東王。二十八年卒。淮南王謀反時，寄微聞其事，私作樓車鏃矢戰守備，候淮南之起。及吏治淮南之事，辭出之。寄於上最親，意傷之，發病而死，不敢置後，於是上（問）［聞］。寄有長子者名賢，母無寵；少子名慶，母愛幸，寄常欲立之，為不次，因有過，遂無言。上憐之，乃以賢為膠東王奉康王嗣，而封慶於故衡山地，為六安王。","source_term":"寄有長子者名賢"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-037","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_K"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003620"]},{"id":"1c8_u63_bk4_KAA","label":"膠東慶（五宗世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"慶","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0016"]},{"surface":"王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0018"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029","quote":"慶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029","quote":"王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029","quote":"膠東王賢立十四年卒，謚為哀王。子慶為王。","source_term":"子慶為王"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-039","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_KA"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003622"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","mention_count":5,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0103","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0142","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0144","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0000","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m029-0012"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","c-shiji-059-wuzong:p029"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-059-wuzong"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kins